<p>Yes, every now and then, in 2026, I still need to rip an audio CD.</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>$ sudo pacman -S cdparanoia lame
$ paru -S abcde
$ paru -S cd-discid
$ paru -S aur/python-eyed3
</code></pre></div>

<p>Finally, I could rip the CD with:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>$ abcde -o mp3 -d /dev/sr0
